{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2LTIwMjAvQmhhc21hc3VyJTIwJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Bhasmasur","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9fDJj3TbDafbDJyS8qK1ABraqbm.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yZCWFSzAYEX7kp2oBMh1S8g5hVn.jpg","description":"Dhaanu, a poor villager, heavily in financial debt, stealthily returns from the city to the village one night. He is hiding from a moneylender who he owes a handsome sum of money. Pushed against the wall, he decides to sell his donkey, Bhasmasur, in the city. Dhaanu's son Tipu, who yearns to go the annual fair in the city, shares a very strong bond with the donkey, Bhasmasur. Tipu in his own childish ways tries to stop Bhasmasur from being sold, but remains unsuccessful. Dhaanu decides to take Tipu to the city too. The trio set off on a journey from the in lands of Rajasthan towards the city, by foot. Along the journey, numerous events take place, bringing the father and son closer. But, will Dhaanu be able to make this bond last?\n\nReleased 12 Oct 2017 · India · Language: Hindi · 75 min\nStudio: East Reel Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"75 min","cast":["Imran Rasheed","Mittal Chouhan","Trimala Adhikari","Raghav Dutt","Ravi Goswami","Bhushan Vikas"],"director":["Nishil Sheth"],"released":"2017-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nishil Sheth","character":"Director"},{"name":"Imran Rasheed","character":"Dhaanu"},{"name":"Mittal Chouhan","character":"Tipu"},{"name":"Trimala Adhikari","character":"Bua","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/38zT3aHkbOyeT35lKkrlUBAke97.jpg"},{"name":"Raghav Dutt","character":"Genie"},{"name":"Ravi Goswami","character":"Bhoora"},{"name":"Bhushan Vikas","character":"Shopkeeper"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"JeNk4ie0IQA","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer: Bhasmasur Trailer -